\pard\plain \fi720\sl288\slmult1\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 I just opened her instagram to unfollow.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 WHY????}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 \hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 Felt like a connection I needed to excise. A sign I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m still not over her.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 I saw that she had new add - My mind immediately jumps to this is the man she is seeing. Maybe. Maybe not. Literally no proof. But it shakes me that this is a possibility. The thought that she could be with someone else cripples me. She *will* be with someone else. I gave her an important part of me and she will be with someone else. That is very hard to process. It feels so wrong. Like the universe has a crack in it. The cosmic plan went awry. Really, that plan is constantly falling apart everywhere, for everyone.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 There is no plan.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 And this leads me to the meat of it.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 There is no plan}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 I need to make it}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Passivity will only ever lead to more of -this- bullshit.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Interrogate my next partner. Be certain of her before falling in love. }}